    "description": "<p>The Dragon-Blood channels the ordered elemental essence of Creation into a ward against chaos and Wyld influence. While this Charm is active, the character is immune to the disorienting and mutation-causing effects of the soft Wyld, and adds (Essence) to the difficulty of any Wyld or chaos-based effect attempting to alter her mind or form. She may also extend this protection to a number of companions equal to her Essence who remain within (Essence x 5) yards of her. Earth and Wood Aspects are especially suited to this Charm, as their elements most strongly represent order.</p>",
